## Commit 2 — Notification service, schema, controller, routes + email helper

```
feat(server/F-9): notification service (fire-and-forget, cursor pagination, mark-read) + email helper

modules/notifications/notification.schema.ts:
  listQuerySchema: cursor? (string), limit? (coerce int 1–50 default 20)
  notifIdParamSchema: id → objectId validation

modules/notifications/notification.service.ts:

  sendNotification(userId, payload) — FIRE-AND-FORGET:
    Writes Notification document, then conditionally sends email.
    Email sent for: event_new, deadline (hoursLeft=48 only), credential_update.
    4h deadline reminder is in-app only — too close to deadline to act on email.
    Pattern: void asyncWorker() — never awaited by caller.
      Ensures notification failures NEVER block or degrade the primary API response.

  getNotifications(userId, cursor?, limit):
    Cursor-based pagination — ObjectId cursor, not skip/offset.
    ObjectId cursors are stable under concurrent inserts; skip() is not.
    Filter: { userId, _id: { $lt: cursor } } sorted { createdAt: -1 }.
    Returns: { notifications, nextCursor? } — nextCursor absent on last page.

  markRead(userId, notifId):
    Idempotent — already-read notification returns 200 silently.
    Guard: userId must match notification.userId → 403 if mismatch.
    Sets readAt = new Date() on the document.

modules/notifications/notification.controller.ts:
  GET  /               → 200 { data: { notifications, nextCursor? } }
  PATCH /:id/read      → 200 { data: { id, readAt } }
  Both thin — parse Zod, call service, next(err).

modules/notifications/notification.routes.ts:
  router.use(requireAuth) — both routes need auth; no role restriction
    (students and faculty can both receive notifications).

services/email.service.ts (MODIFIED):
  Added: buildHtml(title, body, cta?) — shared branded HTML wrapper.
    Teal gradient header, white card body, optional CTA button.
  Added: sendNotificationEmail(to, type, payload) — maps 3 types to HTML.
  Existing sendOtpEmail() and SMTP transport setup unchanged.

Refs: FR-29, FR-30, FR-31
```

